@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
hide circle
left to right direction
class Member {
  - name : String
  - points : int
  + Member(name : String)
  + getName() : String
  + getPoints() : int
  + buy(price : int) : void
  # addPoints(amount : int) : void
}
class VipMember {
  - bonusCount : int
  + VipMember(name : String)
  + getBonusCount() : int
  + claimBonus() : void
}
Member <|-- VipMember
note bottom of Member : 父類別保管點數規則
note bottom of VipMember : 只列本類別新增成員
@enduml
